# 001 Game Creator – recommended .gitignore

# ---- Project & editor temporaries ----
# Autosaves, backups, locks (adjust names if you see different patterns in your project folder)
*.bak
*.backup
*.tmp
*.temp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---- 001-specific runtime & config files ----
# These are usually per-user or regenerated at runtime and shouldn’t be versioned:
# Save files and settings (per docs, stored under Documents\001\Games\[Game])
# If your repo is inside the game folder, ignore these patterns:
SETTINGS.INI
SAVE*.1SV

# Any local editor cache or logs you might see in the project dir
*.log
cache/
Cache/
__pycache__/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/

# ---- Build / export outputs (if you export from 001 into this repo) ----
Build/
build/
Export/
export/
*.exe
*.zip
*.rar

# ---- OS / IDE clutter ----
# Windows
$RECYCLE.BIN/
desktop.ini

# Visual Studio (if you attach C# or other code)
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
obj/
bin/

# ---- Optional: large assets you don’t want in Git ----
# Uncomment and adapt if you store big binaries externally or use a separate asset repo
# Assets/BigVideos/
# Assets/BigAudio/

